# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the C++ suite.
#
# MuJoCo's XML compiler runs its own libc++ thread pool inside the prebuilt,
# uninstrumented libmujoco (mujoco::user::ThreadPool, spawned by mj_loadXML).
# TSan cannot see the synchronisation inside that library, so it reports the
# pool's internal mutex as a race between a compiler thread's allocation and
# another's lock. Nothing from this repo is on those stacks.
#
# Everything this repo compiles is instrumented and is NOT suppressed: the
# VecEnv worker pool, the generation counter, the shared action/observation
# buffers. A race there fails the build.
race:libmujoco
